# sandbox sshd — key-only login as tester; root cannot log in at all.
# Only the options that differ from Debian/Ubuntu defaults (or that must
# never silently change) are stated here; the rest stay at their defaults.
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM no
AllowUsers tester
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
